{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0293_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d6316987ed67cb61ef2e27da2df60eb8602a1fac30f8f560953cda68eef5ac8f", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の、パジャマ特集。\n今日は翼の撮影がある……）", "zh": "（写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的睡衣特辑。今天要拍摄翼……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0293_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c2a1580f88f7159ebc28bfe3abeea228d44e276bc904e5c558fc08d91e799719", "ja": "{$P$}さん、見て見て～♪\nこのパジャマ、すっごくカワイイですよね～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，快看快看～♪\n这套睡衣，是不是超级可爱～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0293_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ffd3b4e04bafcf32cae678f58c50a68667f54d0e575330b4a5f8ccdfd2c93c6f", "ja": "そうだな。翼によく似合ってると思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。我觉得很适合翼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0293_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "585e2adb65ae8b3731d6b2332e48e29cfa6e6c1164daf9b4b09667d99d87e725", "ja": "えへへ♪　{$P$}さんに\nそう言ってもらえると、うれしいな～。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪能听到{$P$}先生这么说，我好开心啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0293_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6c6458fb471411a1661b8b25e03a2d092a2e8e7949774ac0cbc4bb8933dab117", "ja": "あ、そうだ！　今日の撮影って、\nお部屋で普段どおりに、っていうのがテーマですよね？", "zh": "啊，对了！今天的拍摄主题是\n在房间里像平时一样，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0293_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "00ecef24a547248b8aec5d8951262caa704b394361b3cdf1718e90b848f021d8", "ja": "せっかくだから、{$P$}さんと\n一緒にのんびりしたいな～！　ダメ？", "zh": "难得有这个机会，我想和{$P$}先生一起悠闲地待着～！不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0293_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7e7c86d24313210db1e19e22ada8a5414506d0e532c61aee06cf96b41b09b9ee", "ja": "いや、それはちょっと……。\n翼と写るわけにはいかないしな。", "zh": "话是这么说，但这也太……\n我总不能跟翼你一起入镜吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0293_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "634f1838f769b8c289ff0f3066802ae56db773653dbbcdb6a9080456b77bc1df", "ja": "えー、{$P$}さんがそばにいて\nくれたら、もっとカワイイわたしが撮れるのに～！", "zh": "诶——要是{$P$}先生能待在我身边，就能拍到更可爱的我了呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0293_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fb603af6b35f3489614c3e0d026c7d3d8702b107165a7a0e38f662ca82072de1", "ja": "あ、それじゃ……{$P$}さんと\n電話してるところを撮ってもらうのはどうですか？", "zh": "啊，那……请他拍下我和{$P$}先生打电话时的样子，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0293_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "352f915781c7aebf390c9304cf750adf4e474167dbb38b43b2bb8247ea97ceb9", "ja": "電話なら、一緒に写ることもありませんよね？\nえへへ、いいアイディアでしょ♪", "zh": "如果是打电话，也不会拍到我们一起入镜吧？\n嘿嘿，这个主意不错吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0293_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5bb658a628c129989a2bd6b8647f3c3ef504e52d32b4690a192b93989ce2eeb0", "ja": "まあ、パジャマで電話は、似合うだろうけど……。\nけど、本当に掛ける必要はないような。", "zh": "嗯，穿着睡衣打电话倒是挺合适的……不过，好像也没必要真的打过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0293_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "268b48643a425bd4dfcc314ca34a89c3287c3e3b41d091b5e4267b712a12d4ee", "ja": "ダメですよ～、{$P$}さんの声が、\n耳元から聞こえてくるのがいいんです♪", "zh": "不行啦～要听到{$P$}先生的声音从耳边传来才好嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0293_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5180ad18b8ae7628e2a3fb712d22623e4919bf6590b1e301e1425e2a084fda80", "ja": "そのほうが、{$P$}さんが\nそばにいてくれてるって感じがするし！", "zh": "那样的话，也会觉得{$P$}先生就在身边陪着我嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0293_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "04245b83e9d4ab1ac44587deac92dd981983233e22b241000b38704e0d396615", "ja": "だから、電話でお願いしまーす！　設定は、夜寝る前に\n電話してるカップルってことで♪　いいですよね？", "zh": "所以，就请用电话吧——！设定成睡前打电话的情侣♪ 可以吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0293_1014_p", "source_sha256": "20f547f6681bf49c3b6c67b1bb4baed1d2720ed0146ef023a12cfcf8bae33a4f", "ja": "わかったわかった。翼がそれでいいっていうなら。\n精一杯、お相手させていただくよ。", "zh": "知道了，知道了。既然翼觉得这样就好，那就按你说的来吧。\n我会尽全力陪你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0293_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1112bf486c67463f851df04d817f5a6807e706f50f3061637c2e7c8945d3ee04", "ja": "やった～！　それじゃあ、わたしを恋人だと思って、\nあま～い声でお話してくださいね♪", "zh": "太好了～！那就把我当成恋人，用甜甜的声音和我说话吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0293_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "093dfcb8e0c8b9e248291b999b0513147297a5d249101059190b08025595febf", "ja": "わたしもそのつもりで、\nあま～い声でお話しますから！　えへへ♪", "zh": "我也会抱着这样的心情，用甜甜的声音和你聊天！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0293_1017_p", "source_sha256": "078a23ea365ae3a9cd04fc7c581c3b94018b34ab124cb245090a8f2a187ca801", "ja": "（あま～い声なんて、自信はないけど……。\n仕事のためだ、できる限り頑張ってみよう！）", "zh": "（甜甜的声音什么的，我可没什么自信……不过这是为了工作，我会尽力试试的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
